<view class="page">
  <view class="brand row"><view class="logo">启</view><view><text class="brand-name">启晨教育</text><text class="brand-sub">让每一次学习都有回响</text></view></view>
  <view class="hero"><text class="eyebrow">QICHEN EDUCATION · 2026 秋季学期</text><text class="hero-title">今天也要，<text class="orange">向前一点点。</text></text><text class="sub">把好奇变成能力，把坚持变成成长。你的专属学习空间已准备好。</text><button class="primary hero-btn" bindtap="onCourse" data-name="课程中心">探索课程 →</button></view>
  <view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">热门课程</text><navigator url="/pages/courses/courses" class="link">查看全部 →</navigator></view>
  <scroll-view scroll-x class="course-scroll"><block wx:for="{{courses}}" wx:key="name"><view class="course-card" bindtap="onCourse" data-name="{{item.name}}"><view class="course-cover" style="background:{{item.color}}"><text>{{item.mark}}</text></view><text class="course-name">{{item.name}}</text><text class="muted">{{item.teacher}} · 精品小班</text><view class="row price-row"><text class="price">{{item.price}}</text><text class="link">详情 →</text></view></view></block></scroll-view>
  <view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">我的课表</text><button class="outline" bindtap="onLeave">＋ 请假申请</button></view>
  <view class="card"><view class="week row"><text>周一<text>17</text></text><text class="week-active">周二<text>18</text></text><text>周三<text>19</text></text><text>周四<text>20</text></text><text>周五<text>21</text></text></view><view class="class-row"><text class="time">16:30<text>— 18:00</text></text><view class="dot orange-bg"></view><view class="class-info"><text>新概念英语 · Lesson 12</text><text class="muted">启晨校区 · 301 教室 · 王老师</text></view><text class="pill">即将开始</text></view><view class="class-row"><text class="time">19:00<text>— 20:30</text></text><view class="dot blue-bg"></view><view class="class-info"><text>高思数学三年级 · 第 8 讲</text><text class="muted">启晨校区 · 205 教室 · 陈老师</text></view></view></view>
  <view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">小启助手</text><text class="muted">● 在线</text></view><view class="ai-card card"><text>嗨，{{studentName}}，今天想一起解决什么学习问题？</text><view class="quick"><button bindtap="onAsk">帮我讲讲错题</button><button bindtap="onAsk">制定今日计划</button></view><button class="primary ask-btn" bindtap="onAsk">开始和小启聊天 →</button></view>
</view>
